# No application-specific environment variables or .env loader are required.
# Configure authentication through gh auth login, outside this public repository.
# gh inherits its normal environment; never place real credentials here.
# PATH must make gh available (the application locates it with shutil.which).
# GH_REPO is replaced by --repo/the repository field, or removed when blank.
# Captured execution forces GH_PROMPT_DISABLED=1, GH_PAGER=cat, PAGER=cat,
# and NO_COLOR=1; it removes GH_FORCE_TTY. Terminal mode inherits normal settings.
# Local help discovery sets GH_PAGER=cat, PAGER=cat, and NO_COLOR=1.
